<mxCell id="c165" value="Off by default. SafeStitch always works offline. When sync is&lt;br&gt;on, submitted inspections, corrective-action changes and photos&lt;br&gt;are uploaded to your server; offline they wait in a queue that&lt;br&gt;survives restarts. Passwords are never uploaded." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=6.6;fontColor=#64748b;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;" vertex="1" parent="g_S22"><mxGeometry x="14.0" y="99.0" width="202.0" height="34.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
